OL,3,GNEWSAProject to restore rare native
OL,4,Atrees with DNA testing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatrina Bass, from the Long Mead
OL,7,FFoundation in Swindon, is involved in
OL,8,Fthe project and said while the trees
OL,9,Fwere "extraordinary survivors", there
OL,10,Fwere just 50 recorded in Oxfordshire
OL,11,Fcurrently.
